> There's your problem - If you kill humans (like shopkeepers) you will lose
> intrinsics. I'm not sure if it is always telepathy first, only telepathy
> or a random one but the only one I have ever lost from killing humans
> is telepathy.

You lose telepathy from killing a peaceful critter.  It isn't specific
to killing human critters.  There is no danger of losing telepathy from
kill non-peaceful humans like soldiers (provided you didn't cause them to 
become non- peaceful by attacking first or trying to rob a shop etc).  



